The modal height ~? It overflows 390: JOGO PAUSADO + stats + 3 buttons + note = ~420px. Need compact responsive CSS for max-height:430 landscape. There's a media query for max-height 430 orientation landscape that hides `.btn small` and menu stuff, but not pause stats/buttons. We can add:

@media (max-height: 480px) and (orientation: landscape) {
